From bb71f454d339e2bc6bbceef5297093bb8a07a4ae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Owen <3221756+christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 09:58:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] chore(b12x): expunge remaining B12X paths and startup rounds
 from DS4.1

Upstream base: 19f2c20ed4d64ae22bd009ceacadd85e2a81e354 (after 0801).

Rebased from spark-ds41f-1107's series (after 0761) onto candidate-54 and
#1134's 0800-0801, keeping their behaviour: sp_prefill.py keeps candidate-54's
_tp_roce_comm() helper, which now prefers roce_ar_comm over b12x_ar_comm;
candidate-54's decode-overlap helper in attention.py takes the renamed
DeepseekV41Metadata; LogitsProcessor keeps prepare_b12x_vocab_projection as
an alias of prepare_vocab_projection.

Rationale:
1. Move Mxfp4CsfMoEMethod out of vllm/models/deepseek_v4_1/mxfp4_csf.py to
   vllm/model_executor/layers/quantization/mxfp4_csf_moe.py for Kimi-K3 and
   DeepSeek-V4-Flash, and refuse DS4.1 CSF checkpoints.
2. Remove the unused b12x model loader (vllm/model_executor/model_loader/b12x_loader.py)
   and the b12x load format option.
3. Rename DeepseekV41B12xMetadata, DeepseekV41B12xMetadataBuilder, and
   DeepseekV41B12xBackend to DeepseekV41Metadata, DeepseekV41MetadataBuilder,
   and DeepseekV41Backend ("DSV41"), CompressorBackend to "DSV41_COMPRESSOR",
   and cache_dtype_str="b12x_dsv41" to "dsv41".
4. Remove remaining B12X dependencies and lookup_plans from DS4.1 Engram
   (vllm/models/deepseek_v4_1/common/engram.py) and its gate tests
   (test_deepseek_v41_engram_rows.py, test_deepseek_v4_1_engram.py,
   test_deepseek_v4_1_sp_prefill.py), and skip B12X-specific preparation tests
   when b12x is not installed.
5. Make _B12X_SUBMODULES in vllm/utils/b12x.py load submodules lazily on first
   access rather than importing 26 b12x submodules at vllm.utils.b12x import time.
6. Skip the 3 no-op begin_b12x_preparation RPC rounds and prepare_b12x_profile
   PrefixStore exchanges during startup when b12x is not installed, while binding
   lm_head to LogitsProcessor directly in tilelang.prepare.declare_modules.
7. Add backend-neutral names on the TileLang/Sparknet path (prepare_vocab_projection,
   _roce_health_check, _roce_guarded, and roce_ar_comm preference in sp_prefill.py)
   with backward-compatible aliases.

Quality implications: none; bit-identical TileLang/Sparknet execution path.

